  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the proposed project WHH intends to improve the living conditions of highly vulnerable, conflict-affected communities in priority return areas in the Ninewa governorate, through the provision of WASH and protection services. Protection monitoring and referral pathways will enable neglected groups to access humanitarian assistance and their rights. Support will be provided to access basic goods and services, such as health and education.</narrative>
  </description>
